{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00699","headline":"郊庙歌辞 仪坤庙乐章 太和 · 丘说","name":"郊庙歌辞 仪坤庙乐章 太和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孝哉我后，冲乎乃圣。\n道映重华，德辉文命。\n慕深视箧，情殷抚镜。\n万国移风，兆人承庆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}